flowchart TD
    A[User Input<br/>Age, Gender, BMI, Blood Pressure<br/>Glucose, Cholesterol, Symptoms] --> B[Web Application Interface<br/>React Frontend]

    B --> C[FastAPI Backend<br/>Request Handling and Validation]

    C --> D[Data Preprocessing<br/>Missing Value Handling<br/>Feature Engineering<br/>Encoding and Scaling]

    D --> E[Machine Learning Models]

    E --> F[Heart Disease Prediction Model<br/>Random Forest / Logistic Regression<br/>Decision Tree / Gradient Boosting]
    E --> G[Diabetes Prediction Model<br/>Trained Classification Models]

    F --> H[Heart Disease Risk]
    G --> I[Diabetes Risk]

    H --> J[Risk Assessment Engine<br/>Low / Medium / High]
    I --> J

    J --> K[Health Score Engine<br/>Score: 0-100]

    K --> L[Recommendation System<br/>Diet, Exercise and Health Tips]

    L --> M[Dashboard<br/>Prediction Results, Risk Level,<br/>Health Score and Graphs]

    C --> N[Health Coach Chatbot]
    N --> M
